  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.1 - @on{event}:preventDefault and :stopPropagation work (they were written into the DOM and did nothing); typed event args for every Blazor event family (pointer, wheel, touch, drag + DataTransfer, clipboard, progress, error - those handlers used to get EventArgs.Empty and never ran); MouseEventArgs.Detail / MovementX/Y. On SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.2.",
